  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "DataBasePackedFile.GetDdsAsPng and GetDdsAsPngAsync now return the PNG stored under a key of a type tuning uses to refer to images (such as PNGImage) when the package has no DSTImage resource with the same group and instance, rather than failing to decode it as a DirectDraw Surface.\nAdded DirectDrawSurface.GetUnshuffledDdsData, which gets a DirectDraw Surface the way other tools expect it, unshuffling the shuffled surfaces The Sims 4 stores its images as (DSTImage).\nAdded ElectronicArtsAudioCore.GetMp3, which rebuilds The Sims 4's sounds (AudioVocals headers, with their AudioEffects bodies when streamed) as MP3 without re-encoding them, and ElectronicArtsAudioCoreHeader.Read, which reads their headers; the rebuild is adapted from vgmstream, whose license is in Formats/Vgmstream/license.txt.\nAdded ElectronicArtsAudioCore.CreateFromMp3, which makes The Sims 4 sounds (AudioVocals, with an AudioEffects body when streamed) from MP3s without re-encoding them, laying them out as the game does, and AudioConfigurationModel for AudioConfiguration resources (PROPX), which decodes and re-encodes every one of the game's configurations byte for byte.",
